# PRESETS on Arrange (and HOME held + PRESETS anywhere) steps through the scenes in use only: a turn makes no new
# scene (a white key does), and past the last scene in use it comes round to the first (#28)
wait 200
tap HOME
expect page Arrange
expect scene 1
expect used 1
turn PRESET 1
wait 40
expect scene 1
expect used 1
turn PRESET -3
wait 40
expect used 1
tapkey w3
wait 40
expect scene 4
expect used 9
turn PRESET 1
wait 40
expect scene 1
turn PRESET 1
wait 40
expect scene 4
turn PRESET -1
wait 40
expect scene 1
expect used 9
# from another page, HOME held
tap SEQ
press HOME
turn PRESET 1
release HOME
wait 40
expect scene 4
expect used 9
